    "房间和面板标题里的中文字体" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The Chinese typeface of room and panel titles"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "房间和面板标题里的中文字体"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "房间和面板标题里的中文用的是站酷快乐体（ZCOOL KuaiLe），未经修改随 App 发布，按 SIL Open Font License 1.1 授权。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The Chinese characters of room and panel titles are set in ZCOOL KuaiLe, bundled unmodified under the SIL Open Font License 1.1."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "房间和面板标题里的中文用的是站酷快乐体（ZCOOL KuaiLe），未经修改随 App 发布，按 SIL Open Font License 1.1 授权。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "找出照片像房间里的哪件家具，用的是 Meta AI 的 DINOv2 模型（ViT-B/14，带 register），在这台设备上运行。它按 Apache License 2.0 授权，版权归 Meta Platforms, Inc. 及其关联公司。喵空间把它转换成了 Core ML 格式（8 位权重）。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Finding which piece in the room a photo looks like uses Meta AI’s DINOv2 model (ViT-B/14 with registers), running on this device. It is licensed under the Apache License 2.0, copyright Meta Platforms, Inc. and affiliates. Meowverse converted it to Core ML (8-bit weights)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "找出照片像房间里的哪件家具，用的是 Meta AI 的 DINOv2 模型（ViT-B/14，带 register），在这台设备上运行。它按 Apache License 2.0 授权，版权归 Meta Platforms, Inc. 及其关联公司。喵空间把它转换成了 Core ML 格式（8 位权重）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
